eometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="0..1" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#262626;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="c25"><mxGeometry x="0.8" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt; a person can hold several memberships (several AMAPs, or producer and management in the same AMAP, FR-06, FR-07). FAIR runs the platform: its administrators authorise each AMAP and assign its first manager (FR-01, FR-06), and it is the data processor (NFR-08). Capacity is set per AMAP and, per product, in the offer (FR-14)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fontSize=13;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#E17E00;fontColor=#262626;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="690" width="700" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
